<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">- Alago Bible Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">Ofilipi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Okpa ko Obulus da Ase ko Ofilipi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ase ko Ofilipi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ofl</para>
  <para style="mt2">Okpa ko Obulus da</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ase ko Ofilipi</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1" />Bwebe ko Obulus kpo Otimoti, ayole ko Okristi Oyesu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHP 1:1">Gebe kase ko Owuso kpiri okpagye ko Ofilipi, kpa anyakwase kpa awase ni ba yo oko tuwa abo ni. <verse eid="PHP 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2" />Oneshi kpo omene da ala bwebe ko Owuso Ada ka aha kpo Adole Oyesu Okristi.<verse eid="PHP 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Obulus Tinarigwu da awase ni Ba Mokpa Nu ni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3" />Nyya shotunehe do Owuso ishi kpiri ni nrela kala; <verse eid="PHP 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4" />ipu kishi kpiri ni nyya tinarigwu dala, nyya tinarigwu kpo otunehe <verse eid="PHP 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5" />ikweyi koni ala tumabo ko tono ko oshu neshi bweno kikyikyo wishi mani. <verse eid="PHP 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6" />Mani oni ngye mo Owuso ni kwotu ko oko neshi mani ipu kala ni, oya gohobu kpa anu gbe eno ko Okristi Oyesu. <verse eid="PHP 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7" />Oshoshi shini nabi rela kala kpiri, koni ela kala yipu kotu hin ni; koni kpiri kala baba kpa ami anani ni ayun shetu ni kpi ishini ayun shetu walo ni, ala hagye loshu kpa ami ipu ko oneshi ko Owuso. <verse eid="PHP 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8" />Owuso wo olobene hin mun kokwokwoshi dala ikweyi kimu ni ngbo dala kpiri ni, ni bwotu ko Okristi Oyesu abiyinu.<verse eid="PHP 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9" />Inarigwu hin pini yoma: imu kala na gye gohobu ipu ko gyogye kokwokwoshi kpo gyoza oyoya neneshi, <verse eid="PHP 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10" />omani ya talabo ko shoza ni shoshi ni. Shini ala bose sho ozalabi shini ala ka gbepwo lo Eno ko Okristi. <verse eid="PHP 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11" />Olayi kala ya wo olayi neshi ni Oyesu Okristi fufunu yama ni shini ase na migyashi nu kweyi sho Owuso iye.<verse eid="PHP 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Okristi wo Olayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12" />Nabani nyya yimu shala gye, ayene, oza ni tami ni yo oshu neshi gohobu. <verse eid="PHP 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13" />Ikweyi koni, kawo gbeho kole ko ose, kpa ashishini kase gye mo ayun shetu ikweyi koni nwwo yole ko Okristi ni la. <verse eid="PHP 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14" />Oda ko shetu ni nyyanu ni ya ayene nwashika ipu ko Adole pyo oshu kweyi tono kela ko Owuso gboshi lo. <verse eid="PHP 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15" />Owo kwokwoshi ashini wa ba tono ko Okristi ikweyi kanya yoya kpa apwo gbogbo la, ashini wa ke ba ya kpotu neshi. <verse eid="PHP 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16" />Aya mani ipu kimu, ikweyi koni agye mo ayun shetu ikweyi ko hagye doshu neshi la. <verse eid="PHP 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17" />Ashini ba tono ko Okristi kpo okwokwoshi la lo, aba ikweyi kiyiwa la; aba mamo aba bwela manu dami ipu ko oruduru la.<verse eid="PHP 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18" />Owoza kepwo lo! Nshotunehe ikweyi koni atono kela ko Okristi, ka abwowe neshi, ka abwowe labi. Kweyi nyya gohobu ko shotunehe, <verse eid="PHP 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19" />ikweyi koni ngye mo bwebe ki inarigwu kala kpa abo tota bwebe ko Omaku ko Oyesu Okristi, aba yun ngma. <verse eid="PHP 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20" />Otu hin ya yimu nki totuse mo nyya zigbo ipu koko hin lo, ipu kishi kpiri ke, ka anani, nyya yoshi lo, shini ikpiye hin kpiri na geyagye do Okristi, kwun gbo olayi kwun gekwu. <verse eid="PHP 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21" />Koni ebe hin, owoni ngbo olayi owo Okristi la, owoni ngekwu owa abola la. <verse eid="PHP 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22" />Owoni nke gohobu ko yiyi nyya gohobu ko yoko neshi, nggyonya ni nyya shu ipu nu lo. <verse eid="PHP 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23" />Otu hin kepa. Nyya yimu ko sho olayi mani bita na ga yagye kpo Okristi, oni ya shoshi she; <verse eid="PHP 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24" />oke ya shoshi shoshe dala shini na yiyi. <verse eid="PHP 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25" />Ngye mani, mani oni ngye mo nyya yiyi. Nyya yagye kpala kpiri, shini ala gohobu ki gbo otushosha ipu kotuse, <verse eid="PHP 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26" />shini owoni nki yo kpala, ala ba gboza ni ala ki ba gwabotu kpami ipu koyagye kala ipu ko Okristi Oyesu.<verse eid="PHP 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27" />Anani, oza yoya kala na shoshi gyogye kpo oshu neshi ko Okristi, shini, kun wa mala, kun wa mala lo, nyya pwoshu kala mala hagye loshu kpotu oyekponu ba nonu dudu do otuse ko oshu neshi. <verse eid="PHP 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28" />Ala ka yoshi ko omonyekwotu kala lo; ala hagye loshu ishi kpiri, omani ya sayi dawa maba zigbo kweyi ala ba rogwa, ikweyi koni Owuso pini ya yala ba rogwa la. <verse eid="PHP 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29" />Owuso dala ishi ko yoko do Okristi, wa ko kyogwu kpanu kin la lo, ka ko mowe danu. <verse eid="PHP 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30" />Nabani ala wa shan kpefu dudu. Efu ni ala mun ya kpo nekye-nekye ni, kweyi byoni ala pwo ni, ntayayo ya kpefu mani kwikyikyeni.<verse eid="PHP 1:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2" />
  <para style="s">Ziyo Wojije lo Byo Okristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1" />Owoni olayi wo ipu ko Okristi totugbagba, kweyi imu ko Okristi yotu kala sha, ala ba rema kpo Omaku, kweyi ala ba gbotu mene kpi iyinyinyi kiyikala. <verse eid="PHP 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2" />Mani oni nyya bala, ala yun na shotunehe kpiri-kpiri, otu kala na woye, imu kala na woye, omaku kala kpotu kala na woye kponu. <verse eid="PHP 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3" />Ka yojije kimu kiyo kwa ako gwakya kpanu lo, ka zikweyi iso lo, zase ashini mo asho. <verse eid="PHP 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4" />Ka yoza ikweyi koneshi kiyo kin lo, ke yoza ikweyi koneshi kase ashini mamani. <verse eid="PHP 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5" />Arinya wo na woye kponu kpa ko Okristi Oyesu:<verse eid="PHP 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6" />Ni le byoni Owuso we ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:6">oke zo gyogye nu kpo Owuso wojije lo.<verse eid="PHP 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7" />Abishi koni, okyogwu sho ojoji kpiri ni ogbo ni bita,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:7">kweyi ziyinu byo oshe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:7">Owa bya asuse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:7">kweyi bose wese byasuse.<verse eid="PHP 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8" />Ozikweyi iso lo kweyi oyipu ko geyagye gbishini ogekwu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:8">Ikwu ni okyogwu ma anayo poshi ni.<verse eid="PHP 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9" />Oza ni ya ni Owuso ngga anu sha ananaho kweyi odanu iye ni shiye kpiri ni<verse eid="PHP 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10" />Ni olema oni, ipu ki iye ko Oyesu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:10">oza kpiri ni biso, kpo oni yo okpagye ni, kpo ni ba alekwu ni ba geyagye do Oyesu,<verse eid="PHP 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11" />igbenu kpiri ba kamo Oyesu Okristi wa Adole,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:11">ebe ki igyashi ko Owuso Ada.<verse eid="PHP 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yu byo Ola Ipu ke Ese</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12" />Ni olemani oni ala ayene hin moshi, byo ni ala ba geyagye dami ishini kpiri ni, onaka wishi ni nyyo kpa ala lo ni, ishi mani ke, oshoshi shini ala geyagye dami ni nyyo ni kpa ala kelo ni. Ala gohobu kpo geyagye kpo oshi shini ala ngmiyi kala, <verse eid="PHP 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13" />ikweyi koni Owuso oya yoko kpa awo kweyi yo sho yimu ko geyagye doza ni oya yimu shini oya ni.<verse eid="PHP 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14" />Ala ka yoza ipu ka akyose kwe awashu tota lo, <verse eid="PHP 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15" />shini ala ka gbepwo kwi inyi lo byoni ala wayi ko Owuso gyogye ni bese kawase ni yishi kpoza labi ni. Ala yu ipu wa byi inyiwo ni ba yu akpa ni, <verse eid="PHP 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16" />byoni ala ba dawo oleho ko olayi ni. Owoni ala ya mani, nyya gwabotu kpa ala Eno ko Okristi, oya shiya ase mo otakirikwu hin kpoko hin wo oyeye lo.<verse eid="PHP 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17" />Ko owoni aba yun ngmo kweyi yo oyi hin tu shonu byinyi ni otuse kala ya peshi do Owuso ni, otu hin yasha kweyi nyya shotunehe kpala kpiri. <verse eid="PHP 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18" />Mani oni, owotiri shini otu kala na sha kpa ami mamani.<verse eid="PHP 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Otimoti kpe Epafroditus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19" />Owoni Adole kyogwu, nyya to Otimoti oleho ebe kala papa, shini na byotu gbagba ishini npwo oshu ikweyi kala. <verse eid="PHP 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20" />Anu fufunu pini gbotu oyekponu kpami la, kweyi oya dotose kala kwokwoshi. <verse eid="PHP 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21" />Ananoho ba yela kiyiwa kin la, wela ko Oyesu Okristi lalo. <verse eid="PHP 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22" />Ala abiyikala gye mo Otimoti sayi ka arinya neshi, ami kpanu yoko dudu byo oyi kpa ada, ikweyi ko oshu neshi. <verse eid="PHP 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23" />Mani oni nyya yimu ko toleho ebe kala ishini nmoza ni oya we ebe hin ni. <verse eid="PHP 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24" />Kweyi nki ya totusa Adole mami abiyun ya gege ya webe kala kwekwe mani. <verse eid="PHP 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25" />Nke ma mo oya shoshi shini na to oyene kaha ke Epafroditus oleho ebe kala, anu ni yoko kweyi ki kpefu dudu kpami kweyi ki wo oyoleho kala ni ala yo wa tumabo ni. <verse eid="PHP 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26" />Oya yimu ko mala kpiri kweyi otu nu bya koni ala pwo mo oya gbere ni. <verse eid="PHP 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27" />Kokwokwoshi ogbere byo oya gekwu oni. Owuso ke miyinyinyi nu, anu fufunu lalo, omiyinyinyi hin mamani, kweyi oyotu byobya nyakwu bize shun. <verse eid="PHP 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28" />Oni ki wo otata koza ni yun ya yimu ko toleho ebe kala ni, shini otu kala na ki sha ishini ala mo, kweyi otu byobya hin ya kweyi. <verse eid="PHP 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29" />Ala zo kpo otushosha, byo oyene ipu ka Adole. Ala geyagye dase kpiri ni le byanu ni, <verse eid="PHP 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30" />koni oyiyinu dikwu byo oya gekwu oni ikweyi koko ko Okristi, shini ona tumabo, owe ni ala gege lo ni.<verse eid="PHP 2:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3" />
  <para style="s">Aseneshi ko Okwokwoshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1" />Gwejeji, ayene hin, ala shotunehe da Adole. Nyya nwa ko kyo oza ni nta dala ni ta lo ikweyi koni oza mani ya gbeho kala. <verse eid="PHP 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2" />Ala gbera kpa awiwo, awo yoza bibi, awase ni ba shebe kase tola ni. <verse eid="PHP 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3" />Aha pini wofu shoshe la, kweyi aha ba geyagye do Owuso ipu ko Omaku nu, ni shotunehe ipu ko Okristi Oyesu, aha yowada kpi imya kofu shoshe lo, olayi kaha gyotuse kaha ipu ko Okristi Oyesu. <verse eid="PHP 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4" />Koni ami abiyun ya totusiyun kpo oza ni nyya ni. Owoni ashe ya totusa asuse, ami gbo oza ko yotuso ni sho oni ni. <verse eid="PHP 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5" />Nshofu ishini ngyo obize oye ni, amun okpagye ki Izrayila ipu ko ose ko Obenjami. Ene hin kpa ada hin wase ki Oyahuda, ami ki wo Oyahuda. Owoni owa ko gboso ono kase ko Oyahuda ami ya gbera ko gboso ono kpiri koni ami wikpo ko Ofarasi ni. <verse eid="PHP 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6" />Kweyi nyya do oda ko Owuso egye koni nyya gboso ono kase ko Oyahuda sheyi gagye. Owa ko gboso ono ko Oyahuda ami wa kikyikyo ashishe ya pyowe ko kwume epwo lo. <verse eid="PHP 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7" />Kpiri ka awoza mani ke nyyuwa ka wa abola ebe hin, nabani awoza mani nwwa gye kamo awoza yeye ikweyi ko Okristi <verse eid="PHP 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8" />Kpiri kawoza mani kin la lo, nwanyi ko oza kpiri ikweyi koza ni nmo shoshi ikweyi ko Okristi Oyesu Adole hin. Ikweyi nu nyya woza mani kpiri shonu <verse eid="PHP 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9" />nyya mani, shini na rema kpa anu. Ami wa aseneshi ebe ko Owuso kelo ikweyi koni nyya gboso ono ni, Owuso ke yun wase neshi bwebe ko otuse do Oyesu Okristi. <verse eid="PHP 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10" />Oza ni nyya yimu nabani kpiri wako gyo Okristi, kpo oshu ko nyiso amiri nu shini ami na mowe byanu na ki gekwu byanu gekwu ni, <verse eid="PHP 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11" />nyyi iyitagye mo ami wa nyiso amiri ko gbo olayi kweyi na ki showu.<verse eid="PHP 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyinya go Okweyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12" />Nyya kamo nkwobonu yi pye kwe nggya wa lo. Nyya takirikwu ko pya abola ni Okristi Oyesu kwobonu rogwa hin diyinu ni. <verse eid="PHP 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13" />Ayene hin, okwokwoshi ngye mun re wa lo. Oje kponu ni nke yaya ni, nyya nwanyi kpo oza kpiri ni shigbo ni, nyya tikpo ko pyoza ni yohobu ni. <verse eid="PHP 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14" />Mani oni, nyya nyinya tiriri shini na pya abola, ni Owuso yumo ogwu bwebe ko Okristi Oyesu ko gbo olayi iso.<verse eid="PHP 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15" />Kpiri kaha ni gye ipu kotuse ni ahan gbe edo kotu oye kponu owoni ashishini kala gbotu oye gogo, Owuso ya yala ba gyoza mani neneshi. <verse eid="PHP 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16" />Kole mojoji, ahan yabo byoza aha kwobonu pye ni.<verse eid="PHP 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17" />Ala gba ami, ayene hin. Ala zakpaha da ase ni ba kowe ni ashala ni. <verse eid="PHP 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18" />Nkela mani dala ishi nwashika, anani nkyi ya ka dala kpi ize iyi: ase nwashika, bwebe koza yoya wa, awo omonyekwotu ki ikwu ko Okristi ikweyi koshi. <verse eid="PHP 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19" />Okweyi wa wole kola, ikweyi koni ipu wa pini wowuso wa la. Aba gwakya kpo oza ni woza kiweyi ni, kweyi aba yela kiyo kese mani kin. <verse eid="PHP 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20" />Aha ke wayi kole ki iso la, kweyi aba gbeyi ko owowa kino ngmaha Adole Oyesu Okristi ni yawa bwiso ni. <verse eid="PHP 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21" />Oya yi ikpiye kaha ni ya gekwu ni pya kweyi ya yuwa ba le bya akakanu. Oya yoko kpo oshu nu ni yoya gege ko kpogwu kojoji ni.<verse eid="PHP 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4" />
  <para style="s">Ono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1" />Mani oni, ayene hin, nyya yimu kala nwashika kweyi nyya showu ko mala! Ala yotu hin sha kotata, kweyi nyya gwabotu kpala! Ayene hin moshi, ala hagye loshu mani ipu ka Adole.<verse eid="PHP 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2" />Nyya ba ala Oyodiya kpo Osintikyi ala bagye neshi ka ayine kpi iyikala ipu ka Adole. <verse eid="PHP 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3" />Kawawo oya ko oko hin kokwokwoshi, nyya yimu shini ota anya mani abo; koni atumabo kotata ko tono ko oshu neshi, kpo Oklemen kpa ashishini ka awoya ko oko hin, ni ayi iye wa ta ipu ko okpa ko olayi ko Owuso ni.<verse eid="PHP 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4" />Ala shotunehe ipu ka Adole ishi kpiri. Nkyi ya kyanu ya ka: ala shotunehe!<verse eid="PHP 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5" />Gbotumene kpa ananoho, Adole yawa kwekwe mani. <verse eid="PHP 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6" />Ala ka byotu ikweyi kojije lo, ipu ki inarigwu kala kpiri, ala do Owuso oka koza ni ala ba yimu ni, doka kpo otunehe ishi kpiri. <verse eid="PHP 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7" />Kweyi omene ko Owuso, ni sho ogyogye ka asuse kpiri ni, na gbala gbogbo ipu ko otu kpo omaku kala ipu ko Okristi Oyesu.<verse eid="PHP 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8" />Ogwejeji ayene hin moshi, ala yawoza mani shipu kotu kala: oza ni wako okwokwoshi, oza ni shoshi, oza ni yo gyogye, oza ni gbinyi lo, oza ni wa ki imu, oza ni aba myanu, kpo oza ni aba kanu ni. <verse eid="PHP 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9" />Ozani ala fu kpoza ni ala nye bwebe hin ni, ala yoko kpanu, kela koka hin, koza yoya hin. Kweyi Owuso ni ya da ase omene ni ya yo kpala.<verse eid="PHP 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Otunehe Ikweyi ke Eshi Wa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10" />Ipu ko yagye hin ipu ka Adole, owoza kotunehe dami ni itikpi kishi nwashika ala kyi pyishi ko shami mala ba do otose hin ni. Nyya kamo ala nwanyi ami lalo, ala ke pyishi ko sayi nu lo la. <verse eid="PHP 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11" />Nyya kela mani koni atela hin ni la lo, nkwobonu fu ko shotunehe kpoza ni ngbo ni owe wonyonya. <verse eid="PHP 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12" />Ngyoza ni owe ni ko yagye ipu ke eha nkyi gyoza ni owe ni ko gboza sheyi gagye. Nfoje ni ase gye lo ni, ko gbotu kpo oza ni ngbo ni, ishi kpiri ipu kowe wonyonya, kun roza yipu kun ya ngmemye, kun gboza nwashika kun gboza titi. <verse eid="PHP 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13" />Nyya gege ko yojoji bwebe ko Okristi ni dami oshu ni.<verse eid="PHP 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14" />Oke shoshi shini ala tumabo ipu kotu byobya hin. <verse eid="PHP 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15" />Ala ase ko Ofilipi, ala gye neneshi mo bwi ikyikyo hin ko tono ko Oshu Neshi, ishini nsho Omakidoniya bita ni, ala fufu kala pini woda ko Owuso ni tumabo ni la; ala fufu kala pini gbingbo ipu ko oza ni nze kpo oza ni nnye ni la. <verse eid="PHP 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16" />Owi igbo oye lo, ishini nyya doka koza Otesalonika ni, ala toleho da ami. <verse eid="PHP 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17" />Ala ka ma byo nyya yimu keshi la lo; nke ya yimu shini Owuso na fu manu dala la. <verse eid="PHP 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18" />Ala peshi nwashika sheyi gagye dami, osho oza ni nyya doka ni. Epafroditus bye eshi kala kpiri wa da ami. Olema byo oza kpehe ni aze eshi do Owuso ni, eshi popa ni Owuso nye koni oshotu ni. <verse eid="PHP 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19" />Owuso hin ya dala ojoji ni ala ba doka ni bwipu ko odu nu ni sheyi gagye ni bwebe ko Okristi Oyesu. <verse eid="PHP 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20" />Igyashi wa ko Owuso Ada kaha ko gbogbo-gbogbo! Nalemani<verse eid="PHP 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ogbogba ko Ogwejeji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21" />Nyya tase ko Owuso kpiri ni wase ko Okristi Oyesu ni ogbogba. Ayene ni bebeni kpa ami ni ba talogbogba. <verse eid="PHP 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22" />Ase ko Owuso kpiri ni bebeni ba tala ogbogba, otata wase ki ipwole ko Ose Okesa. <verse eid="PHP 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23" />Nyya beshi ka Adole Oyesu Okristi na yo kpa ala kpiri. Nalemani.<verse eid="PHP 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4" />
</usx>